Okay.  For future reference, not only is MR far more valuable than
reflection (I've heard of several reflectionless ascensions, but never
an MR-less one) but there are 2 early sources of possible reflection:
Sokoban and medusa are both 50/50.  IMO, spoilers recommending wishing
for SDSM if you lack MR (for wizards, for instance, SDSM is obvious)
are as misguided as those recommending Magicbane only be enchanted to
+2 instead of +6 or +7 (a clear loss).

And in the long term, the value of having a robe or oilskin cloak
available is _far_ more important than the dubious value of an "oLS,
IMO.

> I'm xplvl 12 now, trying to work up xp to be allowed on my quest. Down
> in lvl 23, I ran into an opulent throne room with a gray dragon, who
> dropped scales. Lo and behold, there was also a scroll of enchant armor
