>
> Question--should I keep using the SDSM, and continue on to the castle
> to wish for a fireproof cloak of magic resistance (I'm just using an
> elf-cloak now--previous good cloak got destroyed when I polied into a
> silver dragon), or should I use the enchant armor to make GDSM, and try
> to uncurse my Amulet of Reflection?

Make the GDSM and put on the "oR now.  You won't want to take it off
until long after you have a means of uncursing it, anyway.

Getting MR and Poison Resistance (and less importantly, sleep res, MC3,
and reflection) are the most important steps toward ascension for me.
"oLS is nice very early as a stopgap until you have those 2, but it's
certainly not worth losing either of them (or the other 3 for that
matter).



